utput directories with native-image-utils generate\")\n    task.setGroup(\"Metadata\")\n    task.doFirst {\n        List<File> inputDirs = requiredDirectoryListProperty(\"inputDirs\", false)\n        File outputDir = file(requiredAbsolutePathProperty(\"outputDir\"))\n        delete(outputDir)\n        List<String> commandLineArgs = [nativeImageTool(\"native-image-utils\"), \"generate\"]\n        commandLineArgs.addAll(inputDirs.collect { File inputDir -> \"--input-dir=${inputDir.absolutePath}\" })\n        commandLineArgs.add(\"--output-dir=${outputDir.absolutePath}\")\n        task.commandLine(commandLineArgs)\n    }\n}\n\n// §AR-test-harness.3.1: run the forked JVM test workers on a JDK that need not be able to host\n// Gradle. Selects an interpreter only — JVM arguments are left exactly as they would be otherwise.\nString testJavaHome = System.getenv(\"GVM_TCK_TEST_JAVA_HOME\")\n// §AR-test-harness.3.1: opt-in escape hatch for a JDK that rejects Gradle's default `-ea`.\nboolean disableTestAssertions = Boolean.parseBoolean(System.getenv(\"GVM_TCK_TEST_DISABLE_ASSERTIONS\"))\n\ntasks.register(\"nativeTestPGOSampling\") { task ->\n    task.inputs.property(\"pgoSamplingPeriodMicros\", pgoSamplingPeriodMicros)\n    task.setDescription(\"Builds the test native image with PGO sampling and the analysis call-tree CSV dump enabled\")\n    task.setGroup(LifecycleBasePlugin.BUILD_GROUP)\n    task.dependsOn(tasks.named(\"nativeTestCompile\"))\n}\n\ntasks.register(\"runNativeTestPGO\", Exec) { Exec task ->\n    task.setDescription(\"Runs the PGO-sampling test native image once and writes the .iprof profile\")\n    task.setGroup(JavaBasePlugin.VERIFICATION_GROUP)\n    task.dependsOn(tasks.named(\"nativeTestPGOSampling\"))\n    task.doFirst {\n        String pgoProfilePath = requiredAbsolutePathProperty(\"pgoProfilePath\")\n        BuildNativeImageTask nativeTestCompile = tasks.named(\"nativeTestCompile\", BuildNativeImageTask).get()\n        NativeRunTask nativeTest = tasks.nam