SameAs(writer);\n        } finally {\n            Thread.currentThread().setContextClassLoader(originalClassLoader);\n        }\n    }\n}\n"}], "isError": false, "timestamp": 1788373233205}, {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_TH41hZYJP8W758ZProjdiBVn|fc_0955a77cecf39d5c016a9868f0ff1087d2bfc36fe0e2e2ebbe", "toolName": "bash", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "metadata/org.apache.activemq/activemq-broker/6.0.0/reachability-metadata.json-626-    {\nmetadata/org.apache.activemq/activemq-broker/6.0.0/reachability-metadata.json-627-      \"condition\" : {\nmetadata/org.apache.activemq/activemq-broker/6.0.0/reachability-metadata.json-628-        \"typeReached\" : \"org.apache.activemq.util.LogWriterFinder\"\nmetadata/org.apache.activemq/activemq-broker/6.0.0/reachability-metadata.json-629-      },\nmetadata/org.apache.activemq/activemq-broker/6.0.0/reachability-metadata.json:630:      \"type\" : \"org.apache.activemq.transport.logwriters.DefaultLogWriter\",\nmetadata/org.apache.activemq/activemq-broker/6.0.0/reachability-metadata.json-631-      \"methods\" : [\nmetadata/org.apache.activemq/activemq-broker/6.0.0/reachability-metadata.json-632-        {\nmetadata/org.apache.activemq/activemq-broker/6.0.0/reachability-metadata.json-633-          \"name\" : \"<init>\",\nmetadata/org.apache.activemq/activemq-broker/6.0.0/reachability-metadata.json-634-          \"parameterTypes\" : [ ]\n--\nmetadata/org.apache.activemq/activemq-broker/6.0.0/reachability-metadata.json-2063-    {\nmetadata/org.apache.activemq/activemq-broker/6.0.0/reachability-metadata.json-2064-      \"condition\" : {\nmetadata/org.apache.activemq/activemq-broker/6.0.0/reachability-metadata.json-2065-        \"typeReached\" : \"org.apache.activemq.util.LogWriterFinder\"\nmetadata/org.apache.activemq/activemq-broker/6.0.0/reachability-metadata.json-2066-      },\nmetadata/org.apache.activemq/activemq-broker/6.0.0/reachability-metadata.json:2067:      \"glob\" : \"META-INF/services/org/apache/activemq/