us builder-style composer APIs for direct JSON output.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.jr/jackson-jr-objects/index.json:30:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Jr Objects is a lightweight data-binding module for reading JSON into maps, lists, strings, wrapper types, arrays, and Java beans, and for writing those values back as JSON. It builds on jackson-core with minimal dependencies and provides immutable JSON entry points plus builder-style composer APIs for direct JSON output.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.jr/jackson-jr-objects/index.json:63:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Jr Objects is a lightweight data-binding module for reading JSON into maps, lists, strings, wrappers, and Java beans, and for writing those values back as JSON. It builds directly on jackson-core with minimal dependencies and also includes builder-style APIs for composing JSON output.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.jaxrs/jackson-jaxrs-base/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"jackson-jaxrs-base provides the shared base classes, configuration helpers, annotations, and utilities used by Jackson's JAX-RS message body providers. It supports Jackson-based integration with JAX-RS providers for serializing and deserializing request and response bodies across supported data formats.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.jakarta.rs/jackson-jakarta-rs-base/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Jakarta RS Base contains shared support code used by Jackson's Jakarta RESTful Web Services providers. It supplies common annotations, configuration, provider base classes, and utilities that integrate Jackson data binding with Jakarta WS RS runtime implementations.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.datatype/jackson-datatype-jsr310/index.json:10:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Datatype JSR310 is an add-on module for Jackson that adds serialization and deserialization support for Java 8 Date and Time API types. It lets ObjectMapper handle java.time classes such as LocalDate, LocalDateTime, OffsetDateTime, and Instant using Jackson's standard module registration mechanism.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.datatype/jackson-datatype-jsr310/index.json:26:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Datatype JSR310 is an add-on module for Jackson that adds serialization and deserialization support for Java 8 Date and Time API types. It lets ObjectMapper handle java.time classes such as LocalDate, LocalDateTime, OffsetDateTime, and Instant using Jackson's standard module registration mechanism.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.jaxrs/jackson-jaxrs-json-provider/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"Jackson JAX-RS JSON Provider integrates Jackson databinding with JAX-RS implementations such as Jersey and RESTEasy to read and write JSON request and response bodies. It supplies MessageBodyReader and MessageBodyWriter providers plus related JSON/JAXB configuration support for REST endpoints.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.jaxrs/jackson-jaxrs-json-provider/index.json:24:    \"description\" : \"Jackson JAX-RS JSON Provider integrates Jackson databinding with JAX-RS implementations such as Jersey and RESTEasy to read and write JSON request and response bodies. It supplies MessageBodyReader and MessageBodyWriter providers plus related JSON/JAXB configuration support for REST endpoints.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.jakarta.rs/jackson-jakarta-rs-yaml-provider/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Jakarta-RS YAML Provider integrates Jackson data binding with Jakarta RESTful Web Services implementations to read and write YAML request and response bodies. It supplies YAML MessageBodyReader and MessageBodyWriter providers, including JAXB-annotation-aware support, for frameworks such as Jersey and RESTEasy.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.jakarta.rs/jackson-jakarta-rs-yaml-provider/index.json:24:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Jakarta-RS YAML Provider integrates Jackson data binding with Jakarta RESTful Web Services implementations to read and write YAML request and response bodies. It supplies YAML MessageBodyReader and MessageBodyWriter providers, including JAXB-annotation-aware support, for frameworks such as Jersey and RESTEasy.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.dataformat/jackson-dataformat-yaml/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Dataformat YAML provides Jackson-backed reading and writing of YAML data through the standard streaming and data-binding APIs. It integrates SnakeYAML as the underlying YAML parser and generator so Java applications can serialize and deserialize YAML alongside other Jackson data formats.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Module Scala adds Jackson databind support for Scala-specific types and language constructs. It provides serializers and deserializers for case classes, collections, maps, tuples, options, enumerations, and related Scala values so Scala applications can use Jackson object mapping.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/index.json:62:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Module Scala adds Jackson databind support for Scala-specific types and language constructs. It provides serializers and deserializers for case classes, collections, maps, tuples, options, enumerations, and related Scala values so Scala applications can use Jackson object mapping.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.dataformat/jackson-dataformat-toml/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Dataformat TOML adds Jackson support for reading and writing TOML documents. It provides TOML parsing and generation through Jackson's streaming and databinding APIs.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.core/jackson-databind/index.json:10:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Databind provides general-purpose data binding and tree-model APIs for Jackson on top of the core streaming API. It converts between JSON and Java objects and can also work with other data formats when compatible parsers and generators are available.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.jakarta.rs/jackson-jakarta-rs-json-provider/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Jakarta-RS JSON Provider integrates Jackson data binding with Jakarta RESTful Web Services implementations to read and write JSON request and response bodies. It supplies JSON MessageBodyReader and MessageBodyWriter providers, automatic provider registration, and Jackson-specific configuration support for REST endpoints.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.jakarta.rs/jackson-jakarta-rs-json-provider/index.json:24:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Jakarta-RS JSON Provider supplies MessageBodyReader and MessageBodyWriter implementations that let Jakarta-RS runtimes read and write JSON through Jackson data binding. It supports automatic provider registration and Jackson-specific configuration annotations for JSON endpoints.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.15.0/reachability-metadata.json:11:        \"typeReached\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule\"\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.15.0/reachability-metadata.json:89:        \"typeReached\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule\"\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.15.0/reachability-metadata.json:229:        \"typeReached\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule\"\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.15.0/reachability-metadata.json:231:      \"type\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule$\"\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.15.0/reachability-metadata.json:235:        \"typeReached\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule\"\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.15.0/reachability-metadata.json:241:        \"typeReached\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule\"\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.15.0/reachability-metadata.json:243:      \"type\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule$\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.15.0/reachability-metadata.json:263:        \"typeReached\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule$\"\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.15.0/reachability-metadata.json:265:      \"type\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule$\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.15.0/reachability-metadata.json:286:        \"typeReached\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule\"\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.15.0/reachability-metadata.json:532:        \"typeReached\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule$\"\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.core/jackson-annotations/index.json:10:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Annotations provides core Java annotation types used by Jackson data-binding and related modules to configure JSON serialization, deserialization, type handling, and property naming. It is a small companion artifact that contains annotation APIs rather than runtime data-binding logic.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.core/jackson-core/index.json:10:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Core provides the core abstractions and streaming JSON parser and generator implementation for Jackson. It lets Java applications read and write JSON incrementally with a low-level token-based API.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.core/jackson-core/index.json:137:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Core provides the core abstractions and streaming JSON parser and generator implementation for Jackson. It lets Java applications read and write JSON incrementally with a low-level token-based API.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.13.2/reachability-metadata.json:11:        \"typeReached\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule\"\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.13.2/reachability-metadata.json:89:        \"typeReached\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule\"\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.13.2/reachability-metadata.json:229:        \"typeReached\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule\"\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.13.2/reachability-metadata.json:231:      \"type\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule$\"\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.13.2/reachability-metadata.json:235:        \"typeReached\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule\"\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.13.2/reachability-metadata.json:241:        \"typeReached\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule\"\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.13.2/reachability-metadata.json:243:      \"type\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule$\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_3/2.13.2/reachability-metadata.json:376:        \"typeReached\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule$\"\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.datatype/jackson-datatype-jdk8/index.json:10:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Datatype JDK8 is an add-on module for Jackson Databind that adds serialization and deserialization support for Java 8 types such as Optional, OptionalInt, OptionalLong, and OptionalDouble. It lets ObjectMapper handle those JDK 8 container types through Jackson's standard module registration mechanism.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-kotlin/index.json:10:    \"description\" : \"Jackson module that adds support for serializing and deserializing Kotlin classes and data classes. It lets Jackson infer constructor parameter names and work with single-constructor classes without requiring explicit property name annotations or default constructors.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-paranamer/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Module Paranamer adds annotation introspection support that lets Jackson discover constructor and factory method parameter names through the Paranamer library. It helps Jackson databind deserialize types whose creators rely on parameter names when explicit Jackson annotations are not present.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-paranamer/index.json:24:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Module Paranamer adds annotation introspection support that lets Jackson discover constructor and factory method parameter names through the Paranamer library. It helps Jackson databind deserialize types whose creators rely on parameter names when explicit Jackson annotations are not present.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-paranamer/index.json:50:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Module Paranamer adds annotation introspection support that lets Jackson discover constructor and factory method parameter names through the Paranamer library. It helps Jackson databind deserialize types whose creators rely on parameter names when explicit Jackson annotations are not present.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_2.13/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"Jackson Module Scala adds support for serializing and deserializing Scala classes and standard Scala collection types with Jackson Databind. It provides Jackson modules and serializers/deserializers that understand Scala language constructs such as case classes, Option values, tuples, maps, sequences, and iterators.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_2.13/2.11.4/reachability-metadata.json:17:        \"typeReached\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule\"\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.module/jackson-module-scala_2.13/2.11.4/reachability-metadata.json:95:        \"typeReached\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.scala.JacksonModule\"\nmetadata/com.faster